From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeremy Melanson <1080872+zish@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 05:14:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: record an origin's encryption when its directory is made

QuotaManager can initialize a temporary origin without its directory,
and makes the directory when a client first asks for it. It then wrote
the origin's .metadata-v2 and its cached record from the client's
OriginMetadata, which need not carry the origin's encryption, though
the OriginInfo did. With dom.quotaManager.encryption.enabled on, an
origin whose data was encrypted was recorded as plaintext, and the
next session opened its databases without their key: on two of three
phones, the next start could not read the site's local storage,
IndexedDB or Cache API (encri-firefox W12). The encrypted state is now
taken from the OriginInfo with the rest of the origin's state.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 dom/quota/ActorsParent.cpp | 14 +++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dom/quota/ActorsParent.cpp b/dom/quota/ActorsParent.cpp
index 71bdcaaa09..c53a115c25 100644
--- a/dom/quota/ActorsParent.cpp
+++ b/dom/quota/ActorsParent.cpp
@@ -3789,22 +3789,30 @@ QuotaManager::GetOrCreateTemporaryOriginDirectory(
     // respective origin directory. So OriginInfo already exists and it needs
     // to be updated because the origin directory has been just created.
 
-    auto [timestamp, maintenanceDate, accessed, persisted, dirty] =
+    auto [timestamp, maintenanceDate, accessed, persisted, dirty, encrypted] =
         WithOriginInfo(aOriginMetadata, [](const auto& originInfo) {
           const int64_t timestamp = originInfo->LockedAccessTime();
           const int32_t maintenanceDate = originInfo->LockedMaintenanceDate();
           const bool accessed = originInfo->LockedAccessed();
           const bool persisted = originInfo->LockedPersisted();
           const bool dirty = originInfo->LockedDirty();
+          const bool encrypted = originInfo->IsEncrypted();
 
           originInfo->LockedDirectoryCreated();
 
           return std::make_tuple(timestamp, maintenanceDate, accessed,
-                                 persisted, dirty);
+                                 persisted, dirty, encrypted);
         });
 
+    // The origin's encryption was settled when its OriginInfo was made, and
+    // the caller's metadata need not carry it. Without it, the origin is
+    // recorded as plaintext over encrypted data, and the next session opens
+    // its databases without their key.
+    OriginMetadata originMetadataWithEncryption = aOriginMetadata;
+    originMetadataWithEncryption.mIsEncrypted = encrypted;
+
     FullOriginMetadata fullOriginMetadata{
-        aOriginMetadata,
+        originMetadataWithEncryption,
         OriginStateMetadata{timestamp, maintenanceDate, accessed, persisted,
                             dirty},
         ClientUsageArray(), /* aUsage */ 0, kCurrentQuotaVersion};
